  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a する verb: {弁護|べんご}する (to defend, to advocate for). Can refer to legal defense or everyday defense of someone's character or actions.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {弁護|べんご}する: to defend, to advocate for\n- {弁護士|べんごし}: lawyer, attorney\n- {弁護|べんご}{団|だん}: defense team\n- {弁護|べんご}{側|がわ}: the defense (side)\n- {国選|こくせん}{弁護人|べんごにん}: court-appointed defense attorney\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n{弁護士|べんごし} (lawyer) is one of the most commonly known compounds using this word.",
